WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.460
- We're not prepared for this.

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.544
- [man] Incoming!

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.963
- [announcer] 
T-minus 3, 2, 1.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:05.881
- Go for ignition.

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:06.715
(button beeping)

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:09.468
(pounding beats)

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.973
(rocket taking off)

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.812
- [Holdenfield] July 20th, 1969.

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:25.651
- [Neil Armstrong] One small
step for man,

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:28.403
one giant leap for mankind.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.866
- [Holdenfield] In school you
were taught that Apollo 11

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.911
lost contact with the
world for two minutes.

00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:40.165
(droid falling)

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:44.962
- Not true.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.800
- They found something on that
day.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.681
That they kept hidden for 50 years.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:01.853
And now, it's too late to stop.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:07.317
- [female newscaster] 
In breaking news.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.903
The governor has just
ordered the mass evacuation

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.989
of the entire West Coast.

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:13.073
- [male newscaster]
Moving to higher ground,

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.451
it's the only possible
chance of surviving.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:20.414
- Stay awake my brothers
and sisters, stay awake!

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:24.751
(intense dramatic music)

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.552
- This planet has
suffered five extinctions.

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:37.764
This is going to be the sixth.

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:42.185
(people screaming)

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:46.565
(explosion)

00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:50.027
- [K.C.] Are we dead?

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:53.864
- No, we are just inside the
moon.

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:56.700
- That might be the greatest
sentence anyone's ever said.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.577
(drone zooming)

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:01.330
(pounding music)

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.626
(intense ominous music)

